he first edition Gangrel Clanbook talks about Jesus meeting a Gangrel in the desert during the three days and nights he was tempted by Satan. Not even kidding. My friend showed me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I think a big chunk of White Wolf's early popularity was due to the fact TSR folded like a deck of cards in the face of BADD to the point of removing &quot;demons&quot; and &quot;devils&quot; as well as marketing to a PG audience.<br /> <br /> People were starving for gaming for adults and White Wolf filled that role even if a bunch of the audience was 13 or so. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I recommend this book for people interested in the subject.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RX4UVWI/ref=dp-kindle-redirect?_encoding=UTF8&amp;btkr=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RX4UVWI/ref=dp-kindle-redirect?_encoding=UTF8&amp;btkr=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Amazon.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RX4UVWI/ref=dp-kindle-redirect?_encoding=UTF8&amp;btkr=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RX4UVWI/ref=dp-kindle-redirect?_encoding=UTF8&amp;btkr=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-19T13:01:22-07:00","id":1390040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1388991-kindred-of-the-ebony-kingdom?p=1390012#post1390012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, don't take this the wrong way but this is completely wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>One gets the impression that some people think that prior to the arrival of the 18-19th Century colonial powers that all of Africa was just tribal huts and nearly naked tribesman hunting with stone-tipped spears and ancestor/animist religious beliefs instead of a vibrant patchwork that ranged from that to countries every bit as advanced (if not more so) as the European powers of the day.<br /> <br /> As just one example, consider Makuria in what is now the Sudan, which became Christian in the 6th century, had a rich artistic heritage, were matrilineal (the king was seceded by his sister\u2019s son and both the eldest sister and queen mother held considerable political power) with full access to education and land ownership by women, ceramic latrines in nearly every building and baths where water was heated and pumped... in the same time period that Europe was in the middle of the Dark Ages and not even fully Christianized.<br /> <br /> Three of the earliest Catholic popes came from Africa, as did a number of early foundational Christian theologians like St. Augustine (one of the most influential in all of Catholic theology).<br /> <br /> Africa and Christianity have been a part of each other longer than claim could be made of Europe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-19T13:50:57-07:00","id":1390054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1388991-kindred-of-the-ebony-kingdom?p=1390023#post1390023\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first edition Gangrel Clanbook talks about Jesus meeting a Gangrel in the desert during the three days and nights he was tempted by Satan. Not even kidding. My friend showed me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, that Sutekh really got around. Things get easier once you unlock the Riddle of Steel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-19T13:58:08-07:00","id":1390056,"title":"","content":"I have got this book (I got it for my Mage: the Sorcerer's Crusade chronicle in Ethiopia) and it's completely wonderful...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51btkTmXQbL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51btkTmXQbL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/